in blavaan, the stanfit object is held in the slot

fit@esternal$mcmcout

You could overwrite it with an new stanfit, but pretty sure you wouldnt get fit indices and log-likelihoods because these are estimated right after sampling, but outside of stan. So, not sure what else would be lost

fit@external$mcmcout <- newstan

